{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2最完整地保住了给予本身的快乐，又把想抓紧亲近、内心发慌和热情收束连成一条因果线；C1次之，C3虽然简洁，但对给予本身带来的满足交代不足。keep：C2明确写出了关心对方、为对方做事本身的快乐，以及付出带来的满足，最完整地保留了v6的五层实质内容；C1和C3都缺少给予本身让他满足这一层，C1对不把喜欢变成催促的表达更贴近原意。cover：C2的想抓紧、发慌、热情到最盛处又收住，最能解释B2和B3，同时想留住亲近也能解释B1的迫切和B4的舍不得；C1次之，C3对情绪升高的交代稍弱。lean：C3把放开去喜欢、舍不得、害怕给对方压力、收回热情连成了最短的因果链；C1多了一层热切起来的过程，C2则在中间铺陈了较多相近的心理状态。plain：C2写到关心对方、为对方做点事这些具体行动，也写出了抓紧亲近时的慌张，最像一个人在讲自己的经历；C1较自然，但真心盼对方好这一层稍有自我劝说的意味，C3则有想确认自己是否特别的紧张暂时退了这样的抽象表达。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "00dfe1da-9710-41c4-aa05-adb004162eba", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T230042706497Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.485, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:02:14.189390+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6e29fff1ed7609fa9bc816b38e782df50f7cdd7b4050ac185b113240113dd4d6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\